# Valkyrie's Call: "Whenever a nontoken, non-Angel creature you control dies, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's
# control with a +1/+1 counter on it. It has flying and is an Angel in addition to its other types." Bot1 casts Isamaru (a 2/2 Dog)
# and then the Call, and on turn 3 Lightning Bolts its own Isamaru. The dies trigger returns the card (a new object, CR 400.7) as a
# 3/3: the +1/+1 counter, flying, and Angel added to the Dog it already is (CR 205.3, 613.1d), with its other characteristics kept
# (legendary, a creature, white). Only the spent Bolt and Black Lotus are in the graveyard afterwards.

